# Vue Components

## SFC template

```vue
<template>...</template>
<script setup>
import { ref, computed } from "vue";
// imports from constants, stores, services
</script>
<style lang="scss" scoped>...</style>
```

## Rules

- **`<script setup>`** only for new components
- Pages in `src/pages/`, reusable UI in `src/components/`
- Use `useGlobalStore()` for shared state — no prop drilling for user/countries
- Emit events with constants from `Events` (`on-success`, `on-error`)
- i18n: `$t('key')` — add keys to locale files, not hardcoded user strings

## Forms

- Element Plus: `el-form`, `el-input`, validation rules
- On submit: `apiRequest` + loader + notify success/error
- Disable submit while loading

## Auth components

`components/auth/`: SignIn, SignUp, MFAChallenge, ForgotPassword — follow existing captcha + error code handling.

## Do not

- Call `axios` directly in `.vue` files
- Use Options API `data()` / `methods` in new code
- Leave `console.log` in committed code
